    rdfs:label "Diagnostic Assessment" ;
    rdfs:comment "TENSION: One passage lists Placement/Formative/Summative/Diagnostic as four coordinate, mutually exclusive categories (modeled above via the disjoint PurposeCategory partition and the functional hasPurpose property). Another passage states 'A common form of formative assessment is diagnostic assessment', subordinating Diagnostic under Formative. The subordinating rdfs:subClassOf ea:FormativeAssessment axiom has been removed to restore satisfiability, since combined with the functional/disjoint purpose axis it rendered DiagnosticAssessment equivalent to owl:Nothing." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ea:Assessment ;
    owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( ea:Assessment [ a owl:Restriction ;
                        owl:onProperty ea:hasPurpose ;
                        owl:someValuesFrom ea:DiagnosticPurpose ] ) ] .

