    rdfs:comment "'It subsumes all other types of validity' / 'the overarching concern of validity research'. See ConvergentValidity/DiscriminantValidity subsumption axioms, which conflict with the disjoint ValidityEvidenceCategory partition above -- both are intentionally retained as a modeled tension where they do not force unsatisfiability. The analogous subsumption axioms on ContentValidity and CriterionValidity were removed because they did force unsatisfiability." ;
    owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( ea:Validity [ a owl:Restriction ;
